WEBVTT

00:00:24.140 --> 00:00:27.070
Go! Shock!! Gourmet!! Gourmet!!

00:00:30.940 --> 00:00:33.840
Go! Shock!!

00:00:35.210 --> 00:00:38.180
Friends who can eat the same dream

00:00:38.280 --> 00:00:41.020
Friends who share the same future

00:00:41.220 --> 00:00:43.720
With you guys

00:00:43.750 --> 00:00:46.720
It’s first-rate gourmet my way!

00:00:46.720 --> 00:00:49.390
If we join forces

00:00:49.460 --> 00:00:52.360
We’ll be invincible

00:00:52.360 --> 00:00:55.700
Come on, let’s show ‘em

00:00:57.930 --> 00:01:02.870
Delicious food gives life

00:01:03.710 --> 00:01:09.010
So be thankful for everything and

00:01:09.010 --> 00:01:11.080
Let’s eat!!

00:01:11.080 --> 00:01:14.020
We can’t lose!! We can’t be stopped!!

00:01:14.020 --> 00:01:17.150
We ain’t gonna let ‘em have that

00:01:17.920 --> 00:01:22.320
We’re gonna win it!! Shock! 
Shock! Gourmet king!!

00:01:22.320 --> 00:01:25.330
Spiked Punch!! Infinity!!

00:01:25.330 --> 00:01:29.030
I’ll punch through with this fist

00:01:29.130 --> 00:01:33.070
First-rate gourmet my way!

00:01:33.070 --> 00:01:35.940
Let’s gather ‘round the table

00:01:35.940 --> 00:01:39.940
For the sake of tomorrow

00:01:39.940 --> 00:01:42.140
Let’s go! Go! Gourmet!!

00:01:51.250 --> 00:01:53.960
Someone once said...

00:01:54.720 --> 00:02:00.500
There are hamburger steaks dripping 
with piping hot meat juices

00:02:00.500 --> 00:02:04.100
that grow in abundance on 
branches of trees like leaves...

00:02:03.930 --> 00:02:08.640
Hamburger Steakleaf created by 
Fuku-chan-san of Fukuoka Prefecture!

00:02:04.100 --> 00:02:08.640
Hamburger Steakleaf Trees!

00:02:11.040 --> 00:02:14.610
The aroma of toasted butter...

00:02:14.610 --> 00:02:19.580
The gentle flavor of milk 
and light and fluffy eggs...

00:02:21.380 --> 00:02:25.390
There are pigs that look 
just like French toast...

00:02:24.850 --> 00:02:30.260
French Toastpigs created by 
Riki-san of Osaka Prefecture!

00:02:25.390 --> 00:02:29.590
French Toastpigs!

00:02:30.620 --> 00:02:34.730
The world is in the Gourmet Age...

00:02:34.730 --> 00:02:40.800
An age in which people quest for 
yet unknown culinary delights!

00:02:42.900 --> 00:02:45.940
The IGO President, Ichiryu, 
sent Toriko to get

00:02:45.940 --> 00:02:48.710
another training ingredient, Bubble Fruit.

00:02:48.710 --> 00:02:52.610
Vanishing Japanese Cuisine

00:02:49.480 --> 00:02:52.610
Toriko and Komatsu arrived at the 
legendary Vanishing Japanese Cuisine,

00:02:52.610 --> 00:02:56.820
where Chiru, the restaurant's master 
chef, told them about Bubble Fruit.

00:02:56.820 --> 00:03:01.150
Bubble Fruit is even deeper 
inside this sea of trees.

00:02:59.490 --> 00:03:04.720
Chowlin Temple

00:03:01.150 --> 00:03:04.720
It's a treasure of the Chowlin Temple.

00:03:05.060 --> 00:03:09.260
The two were led to Chowlin 
Temple by Master Chin,

00:03:06.330 --> 00:03:08.560
Chowlin Temple

00:03:08.560 --> 00:03:11.860
Honor the Food

00:03:09.260 --> 00:03:13.500
the temple master and a Gourmet 
National Treasure himself.

00:03:14.800 --> 00:03:15.730
Spoon!

00:03:20.470 --> 00:03:23.640
However, since they didn't know 
the basics of Honoring the Food,

00:03:23.640 --> 00:03:26.140
Toriko and Komatsu received training baptism.

00:03:27.080 --> 00:03:29.150
But unless you master the 
art of Honoring the Food,

00:03:28.680 --> 00:03:32.720
Chowlin Temple

00:03:29.150 --> 00:03:32.720
you won't even be able to 
touch the Bubble Fruit.

00:03:33.990 --> 00:03:36.950
Including its branches all over 
the world, 100,000 people study

00:03:36.950 --> 00:03:40.690
Honoring the Food at 
Chowlin Temple every year.

00:03:41.290 --> 00:03:44.700
Then Toriko and Komatsu meet Shu, 
the temple's assistant instructor,

00:03:44.700 --> 00:03:47.930
who will further train them in 
the art of Honoring the Food.

00:03:49.230 --> 00:03:51.670
Do your very best.

00:03:51.670 --> 00:03:54.670
As soon as you master Honoring the Food,

00:03:54.670 --> 00:03:57.570
I'll teach you Gourmet Secret Techniques.

00:04:02.080 --> 00:04:08.690
Toriko Totally Defeated?! The Delicate 
and Dynamic Power of Honoring the Food!

00:04:31.840 --> 00:04:36.810
Honor the Food

00:04:33.640 --> 00:04:36.510
That's Chowlin Temple's main hall.

00:04:45.820 --> 00:04:48.560
It's magnificent!

00:04:48.560 --> 00:04:52.460
The Honor the Food training 
course has three stages: basic,

00:04:52.460 --> 00:04:54.230
intermediate and advanced.

00:04:55.030 --> 00:04:59.830
The main hall is the place where the final 
test for the advanced stage is held.

00:05:00.470 --> 00:05:02.540
Chowlin Temple's treasure...

00:05:02.540 --> 00:05:05.040
In order to get the temple 
treasure, Bubble Fruit,

00:05:05.710 --> 00:05:09.880
you have to at least accomplish 
the advanced course.

00:05:10.110 --> 00:05:15.550
I see. The final goal is 
this main hall, huh? So...

00:05:16.080 --> 00:05:19.350
...where is the all-important Bubble Fruit?

00:05:19.350 --> 00:05:23.290
Aren't there any bubbles floating 
around somewhere in the yard?

00:05:23.290 --> 00:05:24.460
Toriko-san...

00:05:24.890 --> 00:05:27.930
There's no way the temple 
treasure is in the yard!

00:05:28.360 --> 00:05:29.600
You're probably right...

00:05:30.400 --> 00:05:31.400
They are.

00:05:32.130 --> 00:05:33.170
Look. There they are.

00:05:35.940 --> 00:05:37.800
They're here?!

00:06:14.540 --> 00:06:16.480
Incredible!

00:06:23.750 --> 00:06:26.180
These are the temple's treasure...

00:06:26.180 --> 00:06:27.790
Bubble Fruit!

00:07:00.650 --> 00:07:03.750
T-They disappeared!

00:07:05.020 --> 00:07:07.790
Even though I didn't take 
one step towards them...

00:07:07.790 --> 00:07:12.160
All I did was reach out to one and 
they all vanished without a trace!

00:07:13.700 --> 00:07:16.330
But unless you master the art

00:07:16.330 --> 00:07:22.140
of Honoring the Food, you won't even 
be able to touch the Bubble Fruit.

00:07:22.510 --> 00:07:25.310
Can you really capture it 
with Honoring the Food?

00:07:27.280 --> 00:07:29.510
Toriko, one of the Four Kings...

00:07:29.910 --> 00:07:32.150
The instant he recognized the ingredient,

00:07:32.150 --> 00:07:34.120
he saw it with the eyes 
of a pro Gourmet Hunter.

00:07:35.450 --> 00:07:37.420
He was like a carnivore eying its prey.

00:07:38.720 --> 00:07:42.890
He had laser-like concentration 
fixed on the ingredient.

00:07:43.730 --> 00:07:45.900
What a waste.

00:07:45.900 --> 00:07:48.560
If he masters Honoring the Food...

00:07:51.430 --> 00:07:52.470
Toriko-san.

00:07:53.470 --> 00:07:56.410
Would you have a bout with me once?

00:07:56.870 --> 00:08:00.080
What?! Scrap with you, 
the assistant instructor?

00:08:00.640 --> 00:08:01.610
Yes.

00:08:02.780 --> 00:08:03.810
Let's spar.

00:08:05.510 --> 00:08:07.220
Are you serious?

00:08:09.890 --> 00:08:11.590
Please follow me.

00:08:11.590 --> 00:08:13.620
There's a martial arts gym this way.

00:08:13.620 --> 00:08:14.620
Hey!

00:08:14.620 --> 00:08:16.360
Shu-san...

00:08:17.230 --> 00:08:20.800
It's fine. I won't hurt you badly.

00:08:24.770 --> 00:08:26.370
What's he up to?

00:08:26.830 --> 00:08:29.300
Why do I have a bad feeling about this?

00:08:34.210 --> 00:08:35.340
Hot!

00:08:36.580 --> 00:08:40.110
The Gourmet Secret Techniques 
need to be passed on to you.

00:08:40.110 --> 00:08:42.920
Rise through the ranks quickly...

00:08:42.920 --> 00:08:44.320
...Tokkuri.

00:08:44.650 --> 00:08:47.750
I mean... Toshimitsu...

00:08:50.090 --> 00:08:51.490
Martial Arts Gym

00:08:52.660 --> 00:08:53.990
Honor the Food

00:09:05.640 --> 00:09:09.010
He may be strong and all, but 
challenging Toriko-san to a fight...?

00:09:15.550 --> 00:09:19.550
Be careful you don't get hurt, 
Assistant Instructor Shu.

00:09:20.820 --> 00:09:23.290
The rules are simple.

00:09:23.290 --> 00:09:25.890
Whoever says "I give up" loses.

00:09:25.890 --> 00:09:27.230
Fine with me.

00:09:28.160 --> 00:09:31.360
Although there's no way those words 
are gonna come out of my mouth.

00:09:31.600 --> 00:09:34.300
Then shall we begin?

00:09:43.310 --> 00:09:46.510
W-Why did this have to happen?

00:09:46.510 --> 00:09:47.280
Komatsu-san!

00:09:47.710 --> 00:09:50.750
After this is over, it's your turn.

00:09:50.750 --> 00:09:52.380
Prepare yourself.

00:09:53.450 --> 00:09:56.150
You're gonna have it out with Komatsu?!

00:09:56.150 --> 00:09:58.520
I don't know what kind 
of match you got in mind,

00:09:58.520 --> 00:10:02.760
but you'll only be able to do it 
if you've got enough strength left!

00:11:06.890 --> 00:11:10.060
Gotta give you props for being limber.

00:11:10.060 --> 00:11:12.390
You're not the assistant instructor 
of Chowlin Temple for nothin'!

00:11:12.830 --> 00:11:16.830
I don't mind if you pull out 
all the stops, Toriko-san.

00:11:16.830 --> 00:11:20.200
Believe me, you needn't 
worry about my well-being.

00:11:20.200 --> 00:11:24.640
Is that right? In that case, 
I'll honor your request.

00:11:28.240 --> 00:11:31.650
Just try not to die.

00:11:45.690 --> 00:11:46.390
Fork!

00:11:56.370 --> 00:11:57.600
Knife!

00:12:03.640 --> 00:12:05.150
Rapid-fire style!

00:12:06.250 --> 00:12:08.120
Flying Fork!

00:12:24.430 --> 00:12:26.170
Then how 'bout this?!

00:12:26.170 --> 00:12:28.600
Leg Knife!

00:12:45.620 --> 00:12:48.720
You surprised me. That 
move has tremendous power.

00:12:49.720 --> 00:12:53.290
Gotta admit, your nimble hopping around...

00:12:54.090 --> 00:12:55.860
...is mighty impressive.

00:12:57.530 --> 00:13:02.730
But you ain't gonna beat 
me by just runnin' away.

00:13:02.730 --> 00:13:04.740
I am attacking you.

00:13:12.110 --> 00:13:12.880
What?!

00:13:13.480 --> 00:13:16.010
My undershirt is being cut up!

00:13:16.310 --> 00:13:17.010
How did you...?!

00:13:18.520 --> 00:13:21.050
My technique is called Small Knife.

00:13:21.050 --> 00:13:25.090
Compared to yours, Toriko-san, it doesn't 
have power and the cutting edge is dull.

00:13:26.360 --> 00:13:31.000
If you want attacking power, it's not 
the right technique to use in battle.

00:13:31.000 --> 00:13:32.660
However...

00:13:33.060 --> 00:13:38.240
...it can cut fabric and 
facial hair well enough.

00:13:39.970 --> 00:13:41.640
Peach fuzz?!

00:13:44.510 --> 00:13:47.610
Feels like I've just shaved!

00:13:48.310 --> 00:13:49.980
Even while moving like a whirling dervish,

00:13:50.480 --> 00:13:55.020
he shaved my stubble without 
even breaking the skin?!

00:13:56.420 --> 00:13:59.890
He can move that delicately?!

00:13:59.890 --> 00:14:03.930
You're a pro at fighting.

00:14:03.930 --> 00:14:09.270
Surely you wouldn't miscalculate 
an opponent's power...

00:14:09.930 --> 00:14:12.470
There's no comparison.

00:14:12.470 --> 00:14:16.110
I'm definitely stronger than he 
is, all the way across the board!

00:14:16.970 --> 00:14:20.110
Even though he's clearly 
inferior to me in strength,

00:14:20.880 --> 00:14:22.080
I can feel it!

00:14:23.210 --> 00:14:26.080
Some unknown domain that I can't reach!

00:14:27.350 --> 00:14:29.650
It's the first time I've 
sensed something like this.

00:14:30.890 --> 00:14:32.020
Is this...

00:14:32.720 --> 00:14:34.390
...Honoring the Food?!

00:14:37.190 --> 00:14:40.230
Well, shall we continue?

00:14:41.060 --> 00:14:44.730
Until you say "I give up"...

00:14:44.730 --> 00:14:49.100
Alright! I'll show you everything I got!

00:14:49.100 --> 00:14:51.010
So I can go beyond that!

00:14:55.780 --> 00:14:57.680
18-fold...

00:14:58.410 --> 00:15:00.350
...Spiked Punch!

00:15:05.520 --> 00:15:09.490
Only you could be this 
well-equipped, Toriko-san.

00:15:10.320 --> 00:15:12.690
You're not even breathin' hard!

00:15:12.690 --> 00:15:17.000
Yet why is it that you, who are 
stronger, have more energy,

00:15:17.000 --> 00:15:19.500
and are at a much higher level than me,

00:15:20.370 --> 00:15:22.670
cannot defeat me?

00:15:23.200 --> 00:15:25.710
It's all because you haven't 
mastered Honoring the Food.

00:15:26.440 --> 00:15:28.840
Fork Shield!

00:15:29.210 --> 00:15:30.240
Honoring the Food...

00:15:31.510 --> 00:15:33.510
...is mental! That is to say...

00:15:34.880 --> 00:15:37.680
...you're apt to think I'm talking 
about the spiritual level...

00:15:37.680 --> 00:15:40.250
...but it utilizes aspects of 
physical strength and techniques!

00:15:40.250 --> 00:15:43.790
36-fold Twin Spiked Punch!

00:15:45.530 --> 00:15:46.590
No good!

00:15:46.990 --> 00:15:47.960
No good!

00:15:48.360 --> 00:15:49.300
No good!

00:15:49.700 --> 00:15:50.730
No good!

00:15:51.300 --> 00:15:53.770
This is no good, too! No good!

00:15:54.470 --> 00:15:55.730
No good!

00:15:56.070 --> 00:15:57.070
No good!

00:15:57.370 --> 00:15:58.440
No good!

00:15:58.640 --> 00:15:59.610
No good!

00:16:07.650 --> 00:16:09.310
Toriko-san, your techniques...

00:16:09.880 --> 00:16:13.790
...have many wasted movements 
and the form isn't correct.

00:16:14.520 --> 00:16:17.920
Thus you consume more 
energy than is necessary.

00:16:21.790 --> 00:16:22.990
Because of that...

00:16:23.800 --> 00:16:27.200
...you actually aren't releasing the 
full potential of the techniques.

00:16:27.200 --> 00:16:29.000
What's that?!

00:16:29.000 --> 00:16:30.170
Toriko-san...

00:16:31.000 --> 00:16:34.110
No matter what, I want to 
teach you Honoring the Food.

00:16:34.640 --> 00:16:38.340
Your attacks were as wonderful 
as I imagined they'd be.

00:16:39.740 --> 00:16:43.010
But if you can master Honoring 
the Food, Toriko-san,

00:16:43.010 --> 00:16:44.480
you'll be able to unleash all your techniques

00:16:44.480 --> 00:16:47.690
while expending only a 20th 
of the calories you do now.

00:16:48.720 --> 00:16:49.990
On top of that,

00:16:49.990 --> 00:16:54.960
their force, speed, and accuracy 
will increase several times over!

00:16:54.960 --> 00:16:59.230
True, currently my techniques 
are a big calorie drain...

00:16:59.230 --> 00:17:03.400
Even now, I'm already outta power...

00:17:03.800 --> 00:17:06.200
Do you acknowledge your loss?

00:17:06.200 --> 00:17:10.310
Training starts with accepting 
the reality of a situation.

00:17:12.440 --> 00:17:15.510
Yeah. Got it.

00:17:15.510 --> 00:17:18.750
I give up. I lost.

00:17:18.750 --> 00:17:20.320
But that's just for now.

00:17:21.320 --> 00:17:24.090
Let's fight again after I 
learn Honoring the Food.

00:17:26.190 --> 00:17:28.220
Yes. It would be my pleasure.

00:17:32.060 --> 00:17:33.430
More importantly...

00:17:33.430 --> 00:17:35.930
I'm starvin'! I feel totally weak!

00:17:36.370 --> 00:17:38.700
Let's get somethin' to 
eat, Assistant Instructor!

00:17:38.700 --> 00:17:40.070
Very well.

00:17:40.070 --> 00:17:43.140
Toriko-san lost?!

00:17:43.140 --> 00:17:44.270
Komatsu-san...

00:17:44.710 --> 00:17:46.170
Let's cook!

00:17:46.170 --> 00:17:48.580
You and I will have a preparation face-off.

00:17:49.310 --> 00:17:50.750
I told you, remember?

00:17:50.750 --> 00:17:53.080
That you're next after Toriko.

00:17:54.620 --> 00:17:57.890
A-Are we really going to do this?!

00:17:58.450 --> 00:18:00.420
But... preparation?

00:18:02.790 --> 00:18:04.390
It's a simple competition.

00:18:04.390 --> 00:18:07.860
Simple... This is Enamel Cabbage, right?

00:18:08.900 --> 00:18:10.600
It's a Special Preparation Ingredient,

00:18:10.600 --> 00:18:12.870
where you need to cut along 
the thin enamel lines

00:18:12.870 --> 00:18:16.740
at a .8 millimeter width or it'll 
lose its freshness in an instant.

00:18:16.740 --> 00:18:19.870
Shredding a head of Enamel Cabbage...

00:18:19.870 --> 00:18:21.880
Let's make it a race.

00:18:21.880 --> 00:18:23.140
You can do that, right?

00:18:23.140 --> 00:18:28.780
Um, pardon my saying so, but 
I'm fast with shredding.

00:18:28.980 --> 00:18:31.750
I don't think it'll take me even 
a minute to shred one head.

00:18:31.750 --> 00:18:33.490
That's amazing.

00:18:33.490 --> 00:18:37.560
Then let's say the side that loses 
has to skip the meal, alright?

00:18:37.560 --> 00:18:39.190
Give it your all, Komatsu!

00:18:40.330 --> 00:18:42.130
I will, Toriko-san!

00:18:42.130 --> 00:18:44.300
When it comes to cooking 
skill, leave it to me!

00:18:44.300 --> 00:18:47.330
I swear I'll avenge you, Toriko-san!

00:18:48.470 --> 00:18:50.170
That's some confidence!

00:18:50.170 --> 00:18:53.510
After all, I've traveled all over 
the place with you, Toriko-san.

00:18:57.280 --> 00:18:58.950
Is that a Melk Knife?

00:18:58.950 --> 00:19:00.250
Yes.

00:19:01.080 --> 00:19:02.980
I can't wait!

00:19:12.120 --> 00:19:13.830
Komatsu-san, too...

00:19:13.830 --> 00:19:17.060
He's focusing on the ingredient 
with such intensity...

00:19:17.060 --> 00:19:17.930
I'm not surprised.

00:19:22.600 --> 00:19:24.900
Okay! I see 'em!

00:19:25.100 --> 00:19:27.070
Then let's begin.

00:19:27.510 --> 00:19:28.210
Ready?

00:19:36.680 --> 00:19:37.320
Start!

00:19:54.200 --> 00:19:55.230
I'm done.

00:20:03.570 --> 00:20:05.310
That's too fast, Shu-san!

00:20:05.310 --> 00:20:08.880
You didn't even take ten 
seconds! What are you?!

00:20:08.880 --> 00:20:13.820
Komatsu-san, your feelings and attitude 
towards ingredients is wonderful.

00:20:13.820 --> 00:20:15.720
But many of your movements are wasted.

00:20:16.490 --> 00:20:19.220
As expected, you too need 
Honor the Food training.

00:20:20.790 --> 00:20:24.690
Shu-chan! Please, do anything 
but take away one of my meals!

00:20:24.690 --> 00:20:25.660
Shu-chan?

00:20:26.300 --> 00:20:27.400
Okay?!

00:20:29.500 --> 00:20:31.830
Don't worry. I'll prepare something.

00:20:41.080 --> 00:20:43.210
Eat a bowl full of beans

00:20:43.210 --> 00:20:46.250
with those five-meter-long chopsticks.

00:20:47.320 --> 00:20:50.250
Training has already begun.

00:20:50.250 --> 00:20:54.720
Damn food takes a delicate touch... I mean...

00:20:53.560 --> 00:21:04.930
Cafeteria

00:20:54.720 --> 00:20:56.760
It's frustrating!

00:20:57.860 --> 00:20:59.160
A little to the right, Toriko-san!

00:20:59.160 --> 00:21:00.930
That's too much! Left-left-left!

00:21:00.930 --> 00:21:02.260
Up-up-up-up!

00:21:03.230 --> 00:21:04.730
Which way?!

00:21:05.370 --> 00:21:10.710
Under our feet, over our heads

00:21:12.470 --> 00:21:18.680
The world is spinning

00:21:21.420 --> 00:21:24.020
A dream flower

00:21:24.990 --> 00:21:27.620
Is blooming, blooming

00:21:28.820 --> 00:21:34.560
Tell me the rest, come on

00:21:34.760 --> 00:21:38.630
Lead me by the hand

00:21:38.630 --> 00:21:42.000
And take me with you

00:21:42.000 --> 00:21:49.380
Don't leave me here alone

00:21:49.440 --> 00:21:53.010
Red shoes

00:21:53.080 --> 00:21:56.620
I can't take off

00:21:56.620 --> 00:22:07.790
I'm the only one dancing

00:22:09.860 --> 00:22:12.900
Find Yun! Run, Run, Yun!

00:22:13.600 --> 00:22:18.100
Yun is hiding somewhere in the image 
you're about to see, so please find him!

00:22:17.440 --> 00:22:20.540
Hiding Level
9

00:22:18.100 --> 00:22:20.210
Today, Yun's Hiding Level is 9!

00:22:20.910 --> 00:22:23.340
The allotted time limit is 15 seconds!

00:22:23.340 --> 00:22:26.210
Are you ready, everyone?

00:22:26.210 --> 00:22:28.710
Let's have a heaping helping of start!

00:22:30.680 --> 00:22:34.020
Don't be deceived by all the 
delicious-looking food now!

00:22:34.020 --> 00:22:36.620
Alright, try to find Yun!

00:22:36.620 --> 00:22:40.230
For those of you who can't find him, 
I'll just give you a one-gram hint.

00:22:40.230 --> 00:22:43.560
I think the center of the screen 
looks a little suspicious...

00:22:44.930 --> 00:22:46.830
Yun is... right here!

00:22:50.870 --> 00:22:52.300
How was it?

00:22:52.300 --> 00:22:55.410
Was level 9 pretty hard?

00:22:55.410 --> 00:23:00.510
Did you avert your eyes from the 
yummy-looking rice omelet and find little Yun?

00:23:00.880 --> 00:23:02.350
Now on to the next segment.

00:23:02.350 --> 00:23:04.820
Please give this a heaping 
helping of your attention, too!

00:23:07.050 --> 00:23:08.570
Focus! Focus! Focus!

00:23:08.570 --> 00:23:11.320
Let the Torch Horsetail burn! Correct your form!

00:23:11.320 --> 00:23:14.160
Honoring the Food requires a super-sized helping of discipline!

00:23:14.780 --> 00:23:17.030
Gratitude is What Counts! The Secret to Honoring the Food!

00:23:17.030 --> 00:23:19.020
Look forward to another heaping helping of fun!
